### Architectural Guarantees & Invariants
1. **Single Source of Truth**: All domain entities live in PostgreSQL via Prisma. No secondary database (Firestore) for core entities.
2. **Strict RBAC & Tenant Isolation**: Every mutating endpoint enforces `authenticate` and `requireRole(...)`. Private documents (resumes, ID cards) are protected behind 5-minute signed URLs.
3. **Database Consistency**: Concurrent operations (e.g. referral slot claiming, event capacity gating, credit transactions) execute in Prisma `Serializable` transactions with retry logic.
4. **Resilient Third-Party Integrations**: All external service calls (Email, WhatsApp, Supabase, OpenAI) have local fallbacks or non-blocking async execution so a 3rd-party outage never brings down user flows.

