### 3.6 Gamification, Daily Streaks, & Badge Engine
- **Streak Calculation Algorithm**:
  ```javascript
  const lastActive = user.lastActiveDate ? new Date(user.lastActiveDate) : null;
  const today = startOfDay(new Date());
  const diffDays = lastActive ? differenceInCalendarDays(today, startOfDay(lastActive)) : null;

  if (diffDays === 0) {
    // Already logged in today -> streak remains unchanged
  } else if (diffDays === 1) {
    // Consecutive day -> streak + 1, update longestStreak
    newStreak = user.currentStreak + 1;
  } else {
    // Missed a day -> reset to 1
    newStreak = 1;
  }
  ```
- **Badge Auto-Awarding**:
  - Automatically queries `Badge` definitions where `user.totalPoints >= requiredPts` and inserts missing `UserBadge` records.

