### 3.7 Watch-to-Earn Video Streaming & Anti-Cheat Heartbeat
- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/video/heartbeat`, `POST /api/video/claim-certificate`
- **Anti-Cheat Mathematical Guard**:
  $$\Delta t_{\text{client}} = t_{\text{current}} - t_{\text{last\_max}}$$
  $$\Delta t_{\text{server}} = \text{Now} - \text{lastHeartbeatTime}$$
  $$\text{If } \Delta t_{\text{client}} > 10 \text{ AND } \Delta t_{\text{client}} > (\Delta t_{\text{server}} + 5) \implies \text{Cheat Flag (Rate-Limit HTTP 429)}$$
- **Certificate Verification**: When `watchedSeconds / totalSeconds >= 0.90`, issues a Certificate with a tamper-proof SHA-256 validation hash.

