### 3.8 Success Story & Achievement Moderation
- **Endpoint**: `POST /api/stories`, `PATCH /api/admin/stories/:id/status`
- **Flow**:
  - Alumni submits story & achievement photo.
  - Admin reviews in `/admin/approvals`.
  - Upon approval, dispatches celebratory email to alumni via `sendAchievementApprovalEmail(...)` and broadcasts to community feed.

