### 3.9 Real-Time Chat & Socket.io Presence
- **Protocol**: WebSocket (Socket.io)
- **Room Isolation**:
  - 1-on-1: `join_room(threadId)`
  - Broadcast: `admin_broadcast` room
- **Presence Map**: In-memory `Map<userId, { socketCount, user, connectedAt }>` emits `presence_change` events on connect/disconnect.

